---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="設計師合作 | 沐築系統家居" description="專為室內設計師打造的B2B系統櫃合作方案，提供優質板材與專業施工。">
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <header class="bg-brand-dark text-white py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">設計師專屬合作方案</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-neutral-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">精準落實您的設計理念，成為您最可靠的系統櫃施工後盾。</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Advantages -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-4">合作優勢</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-primary"><path d="M21.3 15.3a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 0 3.4l-2.6 2.6a2.4 2.4 0 0 1-3.4 0L2.7 8.7a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 0-3.4l2.6-2.6a2.41 2.41 0 0 1 3.4 0Z"/><path d="m14.5 12.5 2-2"/><path d="m11.5 9.5 2-2"/><path d="m8.5 6.5 2-2"/><path d="m17.5 15.5 2-2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-brand-dark">精準對圖與拆單</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-600">專業團隊協助確認平立面圖面，精準拆單，減少現場修改機率，確保施工順利。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-primary"><path d="m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z"/><path d="m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65"/><path d="m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-brand-dark">多元板材資源</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-600">提供多品牌進口系統板材色卡與五金樣品，滿足您對各種風格與質感的設計需求。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded border border-neutral-100 shadow-sm">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-primary"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-brand-dark">嚴格控管交期</h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-600">自有工班調度靈活，從下單到進場安裝，嚴格掌控每個節點，配合您的整體裝潢進度。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Materials & Hardware -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-neutral-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-dark mb-6">嚴選板材與五金</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 mb-6">我們深知材料品質對設計成果的重要性。我們僅選用業界知名品牌的板材與五金，確保您的設計不僅美觀，更經久耐用。</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded text-center font-medium border border-neutral-200">EGGER (奧地利)</div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded text-center font-medium border border-neutral-200">KAINDL (奧地利)</div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded text-center font-medium border border-neutral-200">Blum (奧地利五金)</div>
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded text-center font-medium border border-neutral-200">Hettich (德國五金)</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <div class="aspect-video bg-neutral-200 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
             <span class="text-neutral-400">板材/五金樣品照片 (佔位)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-brand-dark mb-12">B2B 合作流程</h2>
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-start mb-8">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 shrink-0">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">圖面討論與初步報價</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-600">提供您的設計圖面（CAD或PDF），我們將進行初步評估並提供概估報價。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start mb-8">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 shrink-0">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">現場覆丈與細節確認</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-600">陪同至現場確認實際尺寸，並討論收邊細節、水電配置等介面問題。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start mb-8">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 shrink-0">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">確認下單與排程</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-600">圖面確認無誤後，簽訂合作備忘錄或合約，並排定進場施工日期。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-primary text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mr-4 shrink-0">4</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">專業施工與驗收</h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-600">專屬工班進場施作，完工後與設計師共同驗收，確保品質符合要求。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-brand-primary text-white text-center">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">歡迎各大設計公司、個人工作室洽談合作</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">填寫合作表單，我們的B2B專員將盡快與您聯繫。</p>
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "contact/?type=designer"} class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-brand-primary rounded hover:bg-neutral-100 transition-colors font-bold">設計師合作洽詢</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
